<p>Founded in 2015, AirDNA has become the industry standard for STR market data. Their tools are used by individual investors, property managers, real estate companies, and tourism organizations to understand short-term rental market dynamics. The platform offers several products, with MarketMinder and Rentalizer being the most popular among individual investors.</p>

