<p>AirDNA's data reflects what existing listings are doing, which doesn't always predict what a new listing will do. A new property entering a market faces the cold start problem: no reviews, no booking history, and lower search ranking. Actual first-year revenue often falls below what AirDNA projects based on established comparable listings.</p>
